FerrionOS change to relibc (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 74b5e7e315043a21b599f271d5692727aa54f64d with the patches before it in the recipe's list applied:
- restore three-state WAITING_BIT tracking in RlctMutex::lock_inner and RlctMutex::unlock so uncontended pthread_mutex_unlock skips the SYS_FUTEX wake system call; WAITING_BIT is set with compare_exchange (never fetch_or on an unlocked word) and preserved when a woken thread acquires the lock, and a timed-out waiter calls futex_wake(i32::MAX) to drain its stale kernel futex queue entry so no peer waiter can be stranded.

